<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech PSE updates PX50 index composition - April 1.</title>
<headline>Czech PSE updates PX50 index composition - April 1.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) said on Wednesday it would add three issues --Vertex, Jihoceska Energetika and Seliko -- to the PX50 index of the 50 most-capitalised shares on April 1.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that these issues would replace PVT, Sklarny Kavalier and Chlumcanske Keramicke Zavody.</p>
<p>The PSE has been updating quarterly the PX50 content according to market weight, liquidity and listing on the main or parallel markets.</p>
<p>But the bourse said that as of July 1, the adjustment would be done on a semi-annual basis.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
